# Optional

### Definition

Container object that may or may not contain a value.

### Create

```java
Optional.of("Sujeet");

Optional.empty();
```

### Important Methods

| Method        | Purpose           |
| ------------- | ----------------- |
| of()          | Create Optional   |
| empty()       | Empty Optional    |
| get()         | Get value         |
| isPresent()   | Check value       |
| ifPresent()   | Execute if exists |
| orElse()      | Default value     |
| orElseThrow() | Throw exception   |

### Example

```java
Optional<String> name =
    Optional.empty();

System.out.println(
    name.orElse("Guest")
);
```

Output:

```java
Guest
```

