# Most Important Interview Flow

```java
nums.stream()
    .distinct()
    .filter(n -> n > 10)
    .map(n -> n * 2)
    .sorted()
    .collect(Collectors.toList());
```

Flow:

Distinct → Filter → Transform → Sort → Collect

